[{"answer":"Sara, I've heard that you want to move into a homestay family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that correct?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been staying with my aunt and now my cousin is arriving from Singapore","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and my aunt needs the room for him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's bad luck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll need to get some particulars first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sara, what's your full name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sara Lim,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's Sara without the 'h' at the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"How old are you, Sara?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"23, only just.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It was my birthday on the 21st of August.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Happy birthday for yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"How long have you been in Australia?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"A year in Adelaide and 6 months in Sydney.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I prefer Sydney, I've got more friends here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"What's your address at your aunt's house?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Flat one, 539 Forest Road, Canterbury.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And the post code is 2036.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"What are you studying now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I was studying General English in Adelaide","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and now I'm doing Academic English,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"because I'm trying to get into Medicine next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds good, but it'll take you a long time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"When would you like to move out from your aunt's?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousin arrives on Friday morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'd better be out on Thursday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"What, the 7th of September?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"That doesn't leave us much time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I need to know what kind of accommodation you'd like,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so I can get you something suitable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I share a room with someone else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been alone in my room at my aunt's","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've always shared with my sister and I like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll save you money too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like to live with a family or do you think that a single person would be better for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I have lots of very nice single people on my books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any women living alone, retired women?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have quite a few whose children have grown up and left home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I have some really lovely retired ladies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"living by themselves, who just love the company of students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Most of them live in flats, but that's not a problem for you, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Not at all. I'm used to that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"My aunt lives in a flat too, remember.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not used to a big house with a garden, swimming pool, pets and all that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I know quite a bit about what you want now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I should let you know that your rent will be 160 dollars per week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to pay me 320 dollars as a deposit before you move in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"The deposit is as insurance, in case you break something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll need to pay monthly to me, by cash or cheque, I don't mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"You don't need to pay for gas, electricity or water,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but you will need to pay your proportion of the phone bill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Most families do that on an honour system,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"but you'll have to wait and see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you got any more questions for me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"When will you know where I can go?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll work on it now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"so come and see me tomorrow and I should have some news for you then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye. See you tomorrow - after lunch would be better for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, see you then. Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-1-2023-08-12-20-22-23/67.mp3"}]
